        "title": "Understanding Common Ratio",
        "text": "In a geometric sequence, the common ratio $r$ is found by dividing any term by the previous term:\n\n$$r = \\frac{T_2}{T_1} = \\frac{T_3}{T_2} = \\frac{T_4}{T_3}$$",
